Id = "lava_crack"
DisplayName = "Lava Crack"
Description = "Slams the melee weapon into the ground in front of you and hits every enemy around the impact. A glowing crack of lava tears 15 metres through the ground in the direction you face. Enemies standing on it burn for 120% of your weapon damage as fire per second. More projectiles open more cracks, Proliferate branches them off under the first enemies they reach. Needs a melee weapon."
